    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I think I do have a branch with this fixed in it somewhere (as part of a bigger attempted refactor of refcounting). It's probably easier just to make the individual change than to dig it out of something else specifically but I can do if useful.\n\nIgnoring freethreading the issue is more \"arbitrary code in decref\" since that can try to access the dead attribute even in the absence of threads.\n\nI'd claim the proposed fix doesn't hugely improve thread-safety specifically but is the right thing to do.",
